        ("Budget-matched", "For buyers who shared a budget", "Hi [First name], you mentioned you're looking around ₦___ in [Area].\n\nThis just came in and fits 👇\n[3]-bed terrace, [estate], ₦___\n\nWant me to hold an inspection slot for you this week?"),
