        ("Exclusive preview", "Before it goes public", "🔒 *Before I post this publicly…*\nYou're on my priority list, so you get first look:\n[3]-bed [apartment], [Area], ₦___.\nPublic listing goes live [Friday]. Reply *FIRST* to view before then."),
