  tips=["Personalise the first line with the contact's name; it looks like a private message, not spam.",
        "Use *bold* (asterisks) for the headline and price; WhatsApp formats it automatically.",
        "Send media first, then the text, so the caption sits right under the video.",
        "Segment your lists: buyers by budget, investors, diaspora, renters, and other agents.",
        "Send in the morning or early evening, not late at night, and never more than a few broadcasts a week."],
